    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say things get better but it just feels like a lie people tell to keep others going. like, why am i supposed to keep fighting when there is nothing left to fight for? it just feels like i'm stuck in this loop of being a burden and it would be so much more peaceful if i could just... stop. if i could just opt out. is it really so wrong to want that peace?\n house is so quiet and i just feel so alone. i dont",
